rugix — metadata-only Debian source package
=============================================

This source package exists to satisfy archives and image builders such
as ELBE that require a source package to accompany every binary
package. It is not buildable.

The shipped rugix-ctrl-* and rugix-bundler-* binaries are
cross-compiled by the upstream release pipeline; see
scripts/build-binaries.sh and scripts/build-debs.sh in the upstream
repository for the actual build process.

The exact upstream commit that produced the binaries is recorded in
the GIT_COMMIT file at the top of this source package. The Cargo.lock
file captures the resolved Rust dependency graph at that commit.

Upstream source: https://github.com/rugix/rugix/
